One item on this: Scheduled maintenance will take the case systems offline =
overnight. Filing systems and electronic mail are unaffected. Anything you =
have open should be saved and closed before you leave. If you need read acc=
ess during the window, raise a ticket in advance and the service desk will =
arrange a static export. Copies are in the matter folder.